ate with Google or weaken privacy\n* Strip binaries from the source tree, and use those provided by the system or build them from source\n* Add, modify, or disable features that inhibit control and transparency (these changes are minor and do not have significant impacts on the general user experience)\n\nungoogled-chromium should not be considered a fork of Chromium.\nThe main reason for this is that a fork is associated with more significant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium#downloads","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/macchrome/winchrome/releases/tag/v101.0.4951.64-r982481-Win64","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Eloston/ungoogled-chromium","releaseDate":"2022-05-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/macchrome/winchrome/releases/tag/v101.0.4951.64-r982481-Win64","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/101.0.4951.64/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"c2bd68c88fe38aedc508f395bef9d36661cef58f49803528d3b40403d3d9dfe3"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/101.0.4951.64/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"6fc579050330dfb005fdc66023f0f17c82db0130ee4c437cb992523299ada7d7"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/101.0.4951.64/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"a0fda892a193e8abfd03c999490